1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-31","title":"Matthew 26:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>All. 56; 11:6; 24:9,10; Mr 14:27,28; Lu 22:31,32; Joh 16:32 I will. Isa 53:10; Zec 13:7 and the. Job 6:15-22; 19:13-16; Ps 38:11; 69:20; 88:18; La 1:19; Eze 34:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-32","title":"Matthew 26:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>I am. 16:21; 20:19; 27:63,64; Mr 9:9,10; Lu 18:33,34 I will. 28:6,7,10,16; Mr 14:28; 16:7; Joh 21:1-14; 1Co 15:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-33","title":"Matthew 26:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Though. Mr 14:29; Lu 22:33; Joh 13:36-38; 21:15 yet. Ps 17:5; 119:116,117; Pr 16:18,19; 20:6; 28:25,26; Jer 17:9 Ro 12:10; Php 2:3; 1Pe 5:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-34","title":"Matthew 26:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>That. Mr 14:30,31; Lu 22:34; Joh 13:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-35","title":"Matthew 26:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>Though. 20:22,23; Pr 28:14; 29:23; Ro 11:20; 1Co 10:12; Php 2:12; 1Pe 1:17 Likewise. 20:24; Ex 19:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-36","title":"Matthew 26:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>a place. Mr 14:32-35; Lu 22:39-46; Joh 18:1-11 Gethsemane.Gethsemane was a garden at the foot of the Mount of Olives, beyond the brook Cedron; an even plat of ground, says Maundrell, not above fifty-seven yards square, where are shown some old olive trees, supposed to identify the spot to which our Lord was wont to resort.</p>\n<p>while. 39,42; Ps 22:1,2; 69:1-3,13-15; Heb 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-37","title":"Matthew 26:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>Peter. 4:18,21; 17:1; 20:20; Mr 5:37 sorrowful. Mr 14:33,34; Lu 22:44; Joh 12:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-38","title":"Matthew 26:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>My. Job 6:2-4; Ps 88:1-7,14-16; 116:3; Isa 53:3,10; Ro 8:32; 2Co 5:21 Ga 3:13; 1Pe 2:24; 3:18 tarry. 40; 25:13; 1Pe 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-39","title":"Matthew 26:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>and fell. Ge 17:3; Nu 14:5; 16:22; 1Ch 21:16; Eze 1:28; Lu 17:16; Ac 10:25 Re 19:10 and prayed. Mr 14:35,36; Lu 22:41,42; Heb 5:7 O my Father. 42; Joh 11:41; 12:27 if. 24:24; Mr 13:22 let. 20:22; Joh 18:11 not. 2Sa 15:26; Joh 5:30; 6:38; 12:28; 14:31; Ro 15:1-3; Php 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-40","title":"Matthew 26:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>and findeth. 43; 25:5; So 5:2; Mr 14:37; Lu 9:32; 22:45 What. 35; Jud 9:33; 1Sa 26:15,16; 1Ki 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-41","title":"Matthew 26:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>Watch. 24:42; 25:13; Mr 13:33-37; 14:38; Lu 21:36; 22:40,46; 1Co 16:13 Eph 6:18; 1Pe 4:7; 5:8; Re 16:15 enter. 6:13; Pr 4:14,15; Lu 8:13; 11:4; 1Co 10:13; 2Pe 2:9; Re 3:10 the spirit. Ps 119:4,5,24,25,32,35-37,115,117,1; Isa 26:8,9; Ro 7:18-25; 8:3 1Co 9:27; Ga 5:16,17,24; Php 3:12-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-42","title":"Matthew 26:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>the second. 39; Ps 22:1,2; 69:1-3,17,18; 88:1,2; Mr 14:39,40; Heb 4:15; 5:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-43","title":"Matthew 26:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>for. Pr 23:34; Jon 1:6; Lu 9:32; Ac 20:9; Ro 13:1; 1Th 5:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-44","title":"Matthew 26:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>prayed. 6:7; Da 9:17-19; Lu 18:1; 2Co 12:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-45","title":"Matthew 26:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>Sleep on.That is, as it is well paraphrased by Euthymius, \"Since you have thus far failed to watch, sleep on the rest of the time, and take your rest, if you can.\"</p>\n<p>1Ki 18:27; Ec 11:9 the hour. 2,14,15; Mr 14:41,42; Lu 22:53; Joh 13:1; 17:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-46","title":"Matthew 26:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>1Sa 17:48; Lu 9:51; 12:50; 22:15; Joh 14:31; Ac 21:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-47","title":"Matthew 26:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>lo. 55; Mr 14:43; Lu 22:47,48; Joh 18:1-8; Ac 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-48","title":"Matthew 26:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>Whomsoever. 2Sa 3:27; 20:9,10; Ps 28:3; 55:20,21 hold. Mr 14:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-49","title":"Matthew 26:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>Hail. 27:29,30; Mr 15:18; Joh 19:3 kissed him.[Kataphileo ,] he kissed him affectionately, eagerly, or repeatedly, from [kata ,] intensive, and [phileo ,] to kiss, still pretending the most affectionate attachment to our Lord.</p>\n<p>Ge 27:26; 1Sa 10:1; 2Sa 20:9; Pr 27:6; Mr 14:45,46; Lu 7:45 1Th 5:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-50","title":"Matthew 26:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>Friend.Rather, \"Companion, [hetairos ,] against whom ([eph ho] the reading of all the best MSS.) art thou come?\"</p>\n<p>20:13; 2Sa 16:17; Ps 41:9; 55:13,14; Lu 22:48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-51","title":"Matthew 26:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>35; Mr 14:47; Lu 9:55; 22:36-38,49-51; Joh 18:10,11,36; 2Co 10:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-52","title":"Matthew 26:52","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":52,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":52},"content":"<p>Put. 5:39; Ro 12:19; 1Co 4:11,12; 1Th 5:15; 1Pe 2:21-23; 3:9 they. 23:34-36; Ge 9:6; Ps 55:23; Eze 35:5,6; Re 13:10; 16:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-53","title":"Matthew 26:53","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":53,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":53},"content":"<p>and he. 4:11; 25:31; 2Ki 6:17; Da 7:10; 2Th 1:7; Jude 1:14 twelve. 10:1,2 legions.(A legion, [legeon ,] for the Latin legio, from lego, to collect or choose was a particular division or battalion of the Roman army, which at different times contained different numbers. In the time of our Saviour it probably consisted of 6,200 foot and 300 horse, twelve of which would amount to 78,000 men.)</p>\n<p>Lu 8:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-54","title":"Matthew 26:54","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":54,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":54},"content":"<p>24; Ps 22:1-31; 69:1-36; Isa 53:1-12; Da 9:24-26; Zec 13:7 Lu 24:25,26,44-46; Joh 10:35; Ac 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-55","title":"Matthew 26:55","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":55,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":55},"content":"<p>Are. Mr 14:48-50; Lu 22:52,53 I sat. Mr 12:35; Lu 21:37,38; Joh 8:2; 18:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-56","title":"Matthew 26:56","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":56,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":56},"content":"<p>that. 54; Ge 3:15; Isa 44:26; La 4:20; Da 9:24,26; Zec 13:7; Ac 1:16; 2:23 Then. 31; Mr 14:50-52; Joh 16:32; 18:8,9,15,16; 2Ti 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-57","title":"Matthew 26:57","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":57,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":57},"content":"<p>Ps 56:5,6; Mr 14:53,54; Lu 22:54,55; Joh 11:49; 18:12-14,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-58","title":"Matthew 26:58","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":58,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":58},"content":"<p>and went. Joh 18:15,16,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-59","title":"Matthew 26:59","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":59,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":59},"content":"<p>sought. De 19:16-21; 1Ki 21:8-13; Ps 27:12; 35:11,12; 94:20,21; Pr 25:18 Mr 14:55,56; Ac 6:11-13; 24:1-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-60","title":"Matthew 26:60","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":60,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":60},"content":"<p>found none. Da 6:4,5; Tit 2:8; 1Pe 3:16 At. De 19:15; Mr 14:57-59</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-61","title":"Matthew 26:61","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":61,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":61},"content":"<p>This. 71; 12:24; Ge 19:9; 1Ki 22:27; 2Ki 9:11; Ps 22:6,7; Isa 49:7; 53:3 Lu 23:2; Joh 9:29; Ac 17:18; 18:13; 22:22 I am.The words of our Lord were widely different from this statement of them; so that the testimony of these witnesses was false, though it had the semblance of truth.</p>\n<p>27:40; Jer 26:8-11,16-19; Mr 15:29; Joh 2:19-21; Ac 6:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-62","title":"Matthew 26:62","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":62,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":62},"content":"<p>Answerest. 27:12-14; Mr 14:60; Lu 23:9; Joh 18:19-24; 19:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-63","title":"Matthew 26:63","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":63,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":63},"content":"<p>Jesus. Ps 38:12-14; Isa 53:7; Da 3:16; Ac 8:32-35; 1Pe 2:23 I adjure. Le 5:1; Nu 5:19-21; 1Sa 14:24,26,28; 1Ki 22:16; 2Ch 18:15; Pr 29:24 that. Mr 14:61; Lu 22:66-71; Joh 8:25; 10:24; 18:37 the Christ. 16:16; 27:40,43,54; Ps 2:6,7; Isa 9:6,7; Joh 1:34,49; 3:16-18 Joh 5:18-25; 6:69; 10:30,36; 19:7; 20:31; 1Jo 5:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-64","title":"Matthew 26:64","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":64,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":64},"content":"<p>Thou. 25; 27:11; Mr 14:62; Lu 22:70; Joh 18:37 Hereafter. 16:27; 24:30; 25:31; Da 7:13; Lu 21:27; Joh 1:50,51; Ac 1:11 Ro 14:10; 1Th 4:16; Re 1:7; 20:11 the right. Ps 110:1; Ac 7:55,56; Heb 1:3; 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-65","title":"Matthew 26:65","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":65,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":65},"content":"<p>the high priest. Le 21:20; 2Ki 18:37; 19:1-3; Jer 36:24; Mr 14:63,64 He. 9:3; 1Ki 21:10-13; Lu 5:21; Joh 10:33,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-66","title":"Matthew 26:66","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":66,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":66},"content":"<p>He. Le 24:11-16; Joh 19:7; Ac 7:52; 13:27,28; Jas 5:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-67","title":"Matthew 26:67","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":67,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":67},"content":"<p>did. 27:30; Nu 12:14; De 25:9; Job 30:9-11; Isa 50:6; 52:14; 53:3 Mr 14:65; 15:19; 1Co 4:13; Heb 12:2 buffeted him.[Kolaphizo ,] \"smote him with their fists,\" as Theophylact interprets.</p>\n<p>and others. 5:39; 1Ki 22:24; Jer 20:2; La 3:30,45; Lu 22:63; Joh 18:22; 19:3 Ac 23:2,3; 2Co 11:20,21 smote him.[Rhapizo ,] \"smote him on the cheek with the open hand,\" as Suidas renders. They offered him every indignity, in all its various and vexatious forms.</p>\n<p>the palms of their hands. or, rods. Mic 5:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-68","title":"Matthew 26:68","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":68,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":68},"content":"<p>Prophesy. 27:39-44; Ge 37:19,20; Jud 16:25; Mr 14:65; Lu 22:63-65 thou. 27:28,29; Mr 15:18,19; Joh 19:2,3,14,15; 1Pe 2:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-69","title":"Matthew 26:69","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":69,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":69},"content":"<p>Peter. 58; 1Ki 19:9,13; Ps 1:1; Mr 14:66-68; Lu 22:55-57; Joh 18:16,17,25 2Pe 2:7-9 Jesus. 71; 2:22,23; 21:11; Joh 1:46; 7:41,52; Ac 5:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-70","title":"Matthew 26:70","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":70,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":70},"content":"<p>34,35,40-43,51,56,58; Ps 119:115-117; Pr 28:26; 29:23,25 Isa 57:11; Jer 17:9; Ro 11:20; 1Co 10:12; Re 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-71","title":"Matthew 26:71","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":71,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":71},"content":"<p>when. Mr 14:68,69; Lu 22:58; Joh 18:25-27 This. 61</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-72","title":"Matthew 26:72","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":72,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":72},"content":"<p>with. 5:34-36; Ex 20:7; Isa 48:1; Zec 5:3,4; 8:17; Mal 3:5; Ac 5:3,4 I do not. 74; Lu 22:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-73","title":"Matthew 26:73","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":73,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":73},"content":"<p>Surely. Lu 22:59,60; Joh 18:26,27 for. Jud 12:6; Ne 13:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-74","title":"Matthew 26:74","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":74,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":74},"content":"<p>began. 27:25; Jud 17:2; 21:18; 1Sa 14:24-28; Mr 14:71; Ac 23:12-14; Ro 9:3 1Co 16:22 saying. 10:28,32,33; Joh 21:15-17; Re 3:19 And. Mr 14:30,68,72; Lu 22:60; Joh 18:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-26-75","title":"Matthew 26:75","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":75,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":75},"content":"<p>remembered. 34; Lu 22:61,62; Joh 13:38 And he. 27:3-5; Lu 22:31-34; Ro 7:18-20; 1Co 4:7; Ga 6:1; 1Pe 1:5</p>"}]}